BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:WKW: Happy Together (1997)
DTSTART:20260222T021500Z
DTEND:20260222T042000Z
DTSTAMP:20260222T021500Z
UID:SBYyb2MgWr
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nWorld of Wong Kar Wai One of the
  most searing romances of the 1990s\, Wong Kar Wai’s emotionally raw\, l
 ushly stylized portrait of a relationship in breakdown casts Hong Kong sup
 erstars Tony Leung and Leslie Cheung as a couple traveling through Argenti
 na and locked in a turbulent cycle of infatuation and destructive jealousy
  as they break up\, make up\, and fall apart again and again. Presented i
 n 4K.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/world-of-wong-kar-wai/wo
 rld-of-wong-kar-wai-happy-together\n\nEstimated start: 18:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:No Other Choice
DTSTART:20260222T030000Z
DTEND:20260222T053500Z
DTSTAMP:20260222T030000Z
UID:Dsk0mkMyC4
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 139 mins (2h19m)\n\nIn his diabolical new thriller\,
  Park Chan-wook crafts a dark fable about the cutthroat nature of contempo
 rary work culture\, starring Lee Byung Hun as a husband and father who tak
 es violent action after being laid off. Nominated for three Golden Globes
  including Best Motion Picture - Musical or Comedy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.ne
 t/cinema/in-theaters/no-other-choice\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:We Ride Why
DTSTART:20260222T030000Z
DTEND:20260222T042500Z
DTSTAMP:20260222T030000Z
UID:8twWRN9ttr
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 70 mins (1h10m)\n\nPresented by Cascade Bicycle Clu
 b\, Cascade Bicycle Studio\,and Noir Rouge Productions We Ride Why is a d
 ocumentary film about the power of love\, community\, and hope in the face
  of cancer. The film follows the stories of several women who have been im
 pacted by cancer\, as well as the friends and family who support them. Thr
 ough their stories\, we learn about the collateral damage that cancer can 
 bring\, but also the hope that can be found in the relationships that are 
 born out of trauma.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/we-ride-why
 -x40948\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:WKW: Chungking Express (1994)
DTSTART:20260222T050000Z
DTEND:20260222T071000Z
DTSTAMP:20260222T050000Z
UID:D4nA4ieOG9
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nWorld of Wong Kar Wai Two hearts
 ick Hong Kong cops cross paths at the Midnight Express take-out restaurant
  stand\, where the ethereal pixie waitress Faye works. The whiplash\, doub
 le-pronged Chungking Express is one of the defining works of nineties cine
 ma and the film that made Hong Kong filmmaker Wong Kar Wai an instant icon
 . Presented in 4K.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/world-of-w
 ong-kar-wai/world-of-wong-kar-wai-chungking-express\n\nEstimated start: 21
 :15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
